WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.180
Pilgrims in Makkah walk seven
times between two hills.

2
00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.900
They drink water from a spring,
and walk around the Ka'ba.

3
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.460
Every step recalls one
family from long ago:

4
00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.720
a father, a mother and a baby son.

5
00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:18.680
Why do Muslims still walk in
this family's footsteps today?

6
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:23.580
In this mission, you'll follow Ibrahim
from a town full of idols to a dry valley

7
00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:25.080
far from home.

8
00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:29.270
Then you'll compare how the Qur'an and
the book of Genesis tell the story of a

9
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.480
father's hardest test.

10
00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:36.990
Your mission: find out why this family's
steps are still retraced in Makkah today.
